aerographene: infraestrutura de temas de ícone (troca de VectorIcon por ponteiro).

Origem: aerographene (original). Licença: GPL-3.0.
Propósito: gfx::SetVectorIconOverrides(flat_map<const VectorIcon*, const
VectorIcon*>) em ui/gfx; CreateVectorIcon(IconDescription) e PaintVectorIcon
trocam o ícone (e o badge) antes do cache. Comando novo CAP_BUTT (traço com
ponta reta; o join padrão do Skia já é miter, limite 4 como no SVG). Alvo
novo chrome/browser/ui/aerographene_theme_icons (aggregate_vector_icons +
mapa por tema, vazio aqui) e chamada no PostProfileInit do perfil inicial
lendo a pref de perfil "aerographene.theme" pelo nome (theme-builtin).
Mapa vazio = ponteiro nulo = ícones upstream, sem lookup.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/aerographene_theme_icons/BUILD.gn
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# Copyright 2026 The aerographene Authors
+# Use of this source code is governed by the GPL-3.0 license.
+
+import("//components/vector_icons/vector_icons.gni")
+
+# Ícones dos temas do aerographene. Os .icon são gerados por
+# theming/design-language/gen_theme_icons.py (repositório aerographene).
+aggregate_vector_icons("aerographene_theme_vector_icons") {
+  icon_directory = "."
+
+  sources = [
+    # aerographene: theme-icons-default
+    # aerographene: theme-icons-pixelized
+    # aerographene: theme-icon-ublock
+  ]
+}
+
+source_set("aerographene_theme_icons") {
+  sources = [
+    "aerographene_theme_icons.cc",
+    "aerographene_theme_icons.h",
+  ] + get_target_outputs(":aerographene_theme_vector_icons")
+
+  deps = [
+    ":aerographene_theme_vector_icons",
+    "//base",
+    "//chrome/app/vector_icons",
+    "//components/omnibox/browser:vector_icons",
+    "//components/vector_icons",
+    "//skia",
+    "//ui/gfx",
+    "//ui/views",
+    "//ui/views/window/vector_icons",
+  ]
+}
